    "title": "Arsht Center Drops $61 Million Plan To End Miami Parking Nightmares - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ethan Anderson ,\n10 hours ago The Adrienne Arsht Center in downtown Miami is moving ahead with a roughly $61 million campus expansion centered on a new six-story parking garage and cultural studios. The project would stack about 750 parking spaces on site and add roughly 5,000 square feet of community and studio space, a package center leaders say is aimed at shortening the trek from curb to seat and easing a long-running parking crunch around the arts campus. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
